        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e5f8f18-029a-4ef5-be4c-9874e34b0b4c).Image",
        "Description": "Three Employees at a racetrack in Miami have uncovered evidence that an upcoming race is rigged. They have blackmailed our client, Robert Knox, to the tune of millions of dollars. After another demand for money, he decided it would be cheaper to have them eliminated.\r\rHe knows all three will be at the race for the expected drop off, and requests you help them reconsider. \r\rHe&#39;s provided a helicopter for your escape, and needs to be certain you don&#39;t get caught. Good Hunting, 47\r\n\r\nExit: Helicopter",
